---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="更新日志"
  description="LingoSQL 版本更新历史记录，包括新功能、Bug 修复和改进。"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary-50 to-white dark:from-dark-surface dark:to-dark-bg py-20">
    <div class="section-container text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
        更新
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">日志</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        记录 LingoSQL 的每一次更新和改进
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Changelog Content -->
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Initial Release -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700"></div>
        
        <div class="relative pl-8 pb-12">
          <div class="absolute left-[-4px] top-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
          
          <div class="card p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-green-100 text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-400">
                Initial Release
              </span>
              <span class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">2024-01-15</span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">v0.1.0 - 首次发布</h3>
            
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mr-2"></span>
                  核心功能
                </h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 ml-4">
                  <li>• 用户认证系统（JWT）</li>
                  <li>• MySQL 数据库连接管理</li>
                  <li>• PostgreSQL 数据库连接管理</li>
                  <li>• SQL 编辑器与查询执行</li>
                  <li>• 查询结果表格展示</li>
                  <li>• 查询历史记录</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 mr-2"></span>
                  安全特性
                </h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 ml-4">
                  <li>• AES-256 敏感数据加密</li>
                  <li>• JWT Token 认证</li>
                  <li>• 密码 Bcrypt 加密存储</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2 flex items-center">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 mr-2"></span>
                  部署支持
                </h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 ml-4">
                  <li>• Docker 镜像</li>
                  <li>• Docker Compose 配置</li>
                  <li>• 源码编译指南</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Coming Soon -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700"></div>
        
        <div class="relative pl-8">
          <div class="absolute left-[-4px] top-2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-300 dark:bg-slate-600"></div>
          
          <div class="card p-8 border-dashed">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-400">
                即将发布
              </span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">未来版本计划</h3>
            
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-400">
                  开发中
                </span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">查询收藏功能</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">收藏常用查询，快速访问</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 dark:text-yellow-400">
                  开发中
                </span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">表结构管理</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">可视化查看和管理数据库结构</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">
                  规划中
                </span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">AI 生成 SQL</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">自然语言转 SQL 查询</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400">
                  规划中
                </span>
                <div>
                  <p class="font-medium">数据导出</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">支持 CSV、Excel 等格式导出</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-container">
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mb-4">
        想要第一时间获取更新通知？
      </p>
      <a href="https://github.com/yingounet/LingoSQL" 
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex items-center text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400 hover:underline font-medium">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" 
                d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-2.028 1.029-2.716-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.688 1.028 1.623 1.028 2.716 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span>在 GitHub 上 Watch 项目</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
